From c197e3c96f53c1d3a8781a3c8daff64fa9f32486 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: joethedev5 <deepsbx1@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:15:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/18] Reconstruct xnu-13432 translation units absent from
 public tree

Add the 56 source files that exist in the xnu-13432 VMAPPLE DWARF but
are absent from xnu-12377.121.6, with signatures recovered from the
KDK 27.0.1 dSYM:

- 464 functions total; 91 bodies relocated verbatim from the public
  tree (4,025 lines removed from their previous files), 373 explicit
  RECON stubs with panic bodies for disassembly-driven recovery.
- TCP segmentation/ECN/RBBR/timers split out of tcp_input.c,
  tcp_subr.c, tcp_output.c and tcp_timer.c.
- Hypervisor, PPL, DRAM ECC, telemetry, virtual_env, IOKit address
  translator and image4_v2 units added at their reference locations.
- All 56 files registered in bsd/conf/files, libkern/conf/files,
  osfmk/conf/files{,.arm64}, iokit/conf/files and
  pexpert/conf/files.arm64.

Authored-By: joethedev5 <joeshmo@nunya.com>
